# CODEOWNERS
# Paths are matched top to bottom; the last matching pattern wins.
# Replace the placeholder @trakolo/* teams with real GitHub team slugs
# before relying on this for required-review enforcement.

# Default: platform team owns everything in this repo
*                           @trakolo/platform-team

# Production and DR changes get an extra security-team review —
# widest blast radius, tightest gate.
/environments/production/  @trakolo/platform-team @trakolo/security-team
/environments/dr/           @trakolo/platform-team @trakolo/security-team

# Monitoring/alerting changes should be visible to whoever's on-call
/monitoring/                @trakolo/platform-team @trakolo/on-call

# Anything that changes how PRs are gated needs a platform-team review
/.github/                   @trakolo/platform-team
